From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tristin Baker <tristinbaker@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:33:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Menu navigation: hold the d-pad to keep moving, shop wares as
 targets

Holding a d-pad direction in menus now repeats the step (after 300 ms, then every 70 ms), driven from
GUI_UpdateWindows. Moving an item across the inventory took a press per cell.

Shop screens click through one big UIMSG_HouseScreenClick button, so the navigation only had its middle. Houses now
collect where clicks do something while they draw (GUIWindow_House::screenClickTargets): the wares in weapon,
armor, magic and alchemy shops and guilds, and the inventory cells when selling, identifying and repairing.
inventoryCellCenters (ItemGrid) is shared with the character inventory and chests.
